        "message": "=<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <style>\n    body {\n      background: #121212;\n      color: #e0e0e0;\n      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n      padding: 20px;\n      line-height: 1.6;\n    }\n\n    .container {\n      background: #1e1e1e;\n      padding: 25px;\n      border-radius: 10px;\n      max-width: 600px;\n      margin: auto;\n      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      color: #ffffff;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n      padding-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .row {\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .label {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #bbbbbb;\n    }\n\n    .value {\n      color: #ffffff;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n  <h2>📩 New Complaint Received</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Full Name:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Full Name\"] }}</span></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Complaint ID:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Complaint ID\"] }}</span></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Timestamp:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json.Timestamp }}</span></div>\n  \n  <h3 style=\"color:#fff; margin-top:25px;\">📝 Complaint Details</h3>\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Complaint Detail:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Complaint Detail\"] }}</span></div>\n\n  <h3 style=\"color:#fff; margin-top:25px;\">📞 Contact Info</h3>\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Email Address:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Email Address\"] }}</span></div>\n  <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"label\">Phone Number:</span> <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Phone Number\"] }}</span></div>\n\n  <div class=\"row\" style=\"margin-top:20px;\">\n    <span class=\"label\">Category:</span> \n    <span class=\"value\">{{ $json[\"Optional Category\"] }}</span>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n",
